WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.072
The first CTE remains at admission grain and adds
previous discharge The

00:00:06.099 --> 00:00:12.783
second CTE keeps only admissions with a previous
encounter and calculates the gap The

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:18.873
final query joins patient names and applies the
thirty-day classification Run

00:00:18.899 --> 00:00:24.458
it and read the query stage by stage Notice that the
patient join is

00:00:24.484 --> 00:00:29.431
delayed until the final result because it is
descriptive rather than needed for sequence logic
